---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';import ResponsiveImage from '../components/ResponsiveImage.astro';import BookingCTA from '../sections/BookingCTA.astro';import {photos} from '../data/properties';import {landscapes} from '../data/landscapes';import LandscapeBreak from '../components/LandscapeBreak.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="旅居体验" image={photos.room2[2].src}><section class="page-heading container"><p class="section-label">The everyday, considered</p><h1 class="display">Space to settle.<br>Room to <em>live.</em></h1><p>让新的城市生活，保留熟悉的舒适。</p></section><section class="container editorial-story"><div class="story-image"><ResponsiveImage photo={photos.room2[2]} priority/></div><div class="story-copy"><h2>窗边的光，<br>属于自己的时间。</h2><p>从清晨到暮色，空间里的自然光，让日常拥有不同的表情。独立住宿，为学习、工作后的生活留出自己的节奏。</p><a class="text-link" href="/stays/">探索独立住宿</a></div></section><section class="container section editorial-story story-reverse"><div class="story-image"><ResponsiveImage photo={photos.room2[1]}/></div><div class="story-copy"><h2>生活所需，<br>从容安放。</h2><p>家具家电、水电网络已包含。可以慢慢吃一顿饭，也可以在忙碌的一天后安顿自己。入住细节与租期安排，我们会与你确认。</p></div></section><section class="container section editorial-story"><div class="story-image"><ResponsiveImage photo={landscapes.city}/></div><div class="story-copy"><h2>城市就在身边。</h2><p>147 Victoria Street West，靠近天空塔、高速与各大超市。采购与出行的便利，让更多时间回到生活本身。</p><a class="text-link" href="/locations/">了解住宿位置</a></div></section><LandscapeBreak scene="sunset" title="Beyond the everyday." subtitle="湖畔暮色，留给下一段旅程的风景。"/><BookingCTA/></BaseLayout>
